# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RIVAAZ GLAM STUDIO / KS BEAUTY - LIVE EMAIL CONFIGURATION
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# To enable real live email delivery to client & owner inboxes:
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.emailjs.com (2 minutes)
# 2. Add an Email Service (Gmail or SMTP) under "Email Services" -> Copy Service ID
# 3. Create 2 Email Templates under "Email Templates":
#    - Template 1 (Client Receipt): Auto-reply to client
#    - Template 2 (Owner Alert): Notification to owner inbox
# 4. Copy your Public Key under "Account" -> "API Keys"
# 5. Create a local `.env` file in the root folder with these variables:

VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=service_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_CLIENT_TEMPLATE_ID=template_xxxxxxx
VITE_EMAILJS_OWNER_TEMPLATE_ID=template_yyyyyyy
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=public_xxxxxxx
VITE_OWNER_EMAIL=rivaaz.glam@gmail.com
